P={
2:["November, twenty twenty-five.","Cyclone Ditwah tears across Sri Lanka."],
3:["Now look north. Off the Jaffna coast, four islands keep their own lights on.","Delft.","Nainativu.","Analaitivu.","Eluvaitivu.","No cable to the mainland.","Every drop of fuel arrives by boat."],
4:["Around nine thousand people live here. A hospital. A water plant.","Last year, these grids burned nine hundred and seventy-five thousand litres of diesel,","for nearly three gigawatt-hours","at up to one hundred and eighteen rupees a unit."],
5:["Now imagine the storm hits. The operators are evacuated.","The data goes dark.","And the grid has to decide... on its own."],
6:["Hand that call to an ordinary AI, and it answers with total confidence. Even when it's wrong. One bad call, and the whole island goes black.","So we asked a different question. What if the AI knew... when it didn't know?"],
7:["This is MetaCore."],
8:["It reads the grid as a living graph of weather, load and generation.","It measures its own doubt.","When the answer is clear, it acts fast.","When it isn't, it slows down, and thinks."],
9:["And here's the part we're proudest of. Before any action touches the grid, a deterministic physics firewall replays it on a digital twin.","Voltage.","Line loading.","Generation.","Convergence.","Every action gets a verdict.","Approve.","Reject.","Or unverified, with its risk attached.","Nothing executes without approval, and every rejection teaches the agent why."],
10:["Same storm. Same proposal.","This time, the doubt is caught.","The unsafe action is blocked.","And the lights stay on."],
11:["We built this for the Ceylon Electricity Board.","For the families on these islands.","And for every remote, coastal grid that simply cannot afford a guess."],
12:["MetaCore.","It knows when it doesn't know.","And it verifies, before it acts."],
}
